    <briefdescription>
<para>Async, non-blocking SAGA log compaction interface. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="classthemis_1_1utils_1_1_i_s_a_g_a_log_compactor_1a7269c58da960cb01c963a850eb625d94" kindref="member">compact()</ref> returns immediately; compaction proceeds in the background. The returned future resolves when the background pass completes.</para>
<para>Compaction MUST preserve all committed SAGA entries; only uncommitted or superseded entries may be removed. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
